  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Light illusion bat wings is named as a movement killer move when Fang Yuan uses it to chase and still cannot catch Plump Lady.",
      "chapters": [
        675
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_plump_lady"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Plump Lady’s own escape is also a movement killer move, and that flight outpaces him.",
      "chapters": [
        681
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gu Immortals with weak direct battle strength can still hold many movement killer moves; underground speed can match ordinary Gu Immortal flight.",
      "chapters": [
        675
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Kong Sheng Tian is a movement killer move created with Qi Escape Gu as the reference. It opens pores and blows out air currents so the Gu Immortal flies forward quickly and can change direction with agility.",
      "chapters": [
        678
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "kong-sheng-tian",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_kong_sheng_tian",
        "gu_qi_escape_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "It conflicts with hair armor: using one prevents the other.",
      "chapters": [
        679
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "kong-sheng-tian",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Light illusion bat wings is the most widely spread movement killer move of the five regions chaotic war memory for its price to value ratio. Fang Yuan’s modified true solid bat wings raises speed further and could sell for six immortal essence stones or more in treasure yellow heaven.",
      "chapters": [
        713
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "market-tier",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fairy Jiang Yu teleports He Lang Zi away with an immortal movement killer move, showing the same role at immortal grade: repositioning rather than direct attack.",
      "chapters": [
        765
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "immortal-grade-teleport",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fairy_jiang_yu",
        "char_he_lang_zi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Killer moves as Gu combinations in general are covered on killer moves. Offensive forms are covered on Offensive Killer Move. Defensive forms are covered on Defensive Killer Move. Healing forms are covered on Healing Killer Move.",
